    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor Strain - Season 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/49fa1da91e1899d9388a94c41500544a.avif?t=1748711257\" width=732 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s been two years since the so-called first wave, where hordes of infected swept across the land, leaving the world in ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handful of cities still stand\u2014but the question remains: for how long?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During these events, you were simply a tourist in South America, unexpectedly ensnared by these extraordinary circumstances. You were forced to adapt to a reality far removed from home, navigating survival in an unfamiliar land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/b0b03de7c1f73b4ea7d8e99ec8d1da11.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of how you try to survive and adapt to the new world, creating and protecting your faction of survivors. In this new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the danger grows, so do you. Every choice you make shapes the person you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the one thing your enemies fear most\u2014or will you avoid bloodshed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/76dcb1ebd284eec099ee46c250c18e42.avif?t=1748711257\" width=732 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-quality graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game\u2019s art was made by an experienced 3D artist who, after years of creating art, decided to develop his own game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers a very different quality compared to other AVNs, as the artist used his own skills to carefully shape every character and detail, molding them using 100% 3D software.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/1faeefb5726abddf82dff17a2de5453b.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every girl has her own personality and backstory. Some of them have struggles and internal battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/61107d4c09f0a8de7cb534c14b34b03d.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall in Love</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All relationships are optional\u2014you can pursue only the girls you like, or go after all of them\u2026 (Harem optional)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance is a significant aspect of this game, so if you enjoy romantic themes combined with action, this game is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/7b5df933a23c82e067975b33c79b575c.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions on the Rise</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the rise of several major factions in this new world\u2014each with the potential to become powerful allies\u2026 or dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/ca4e386de4113147072548b907b62b5a.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Aftermath</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through the ruins of a world shattered by an unstoppable outbreak. In every corner, a story waits to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/49fa1da91e1899d9388a94c41500544a.avif?t=1748711257\" width=732 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The virus has many variants and mutations. Besides the average infected, you\u2019ll come across a wide range of other creatures. Will you endure this new world and become a hardened survivor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/c9ff44d2bda5a3a6b810660d4e24f2f1.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise of Your Faction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the rise of your faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/b6c10fcd8a847092d732d48a122adc49.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And of course, have a lot of fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains a high amount of adult scenes, and most interactions besides vaginal sex are optional. It's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/cbaf69b8015bc628ca0ecf7ec909fd38.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very Carefully Crafted Animations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with precision, each animation features frame-by-frame construction and seamless loops, ensuring continuous, lifelike motion without visible cuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568390/extras/786f5270bfa40764745f1466464ee3be.avif?t=1748711257\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first season of a thrilling zombie apocalypse universe, featuring three long episodes. Created by a fan of zombie movies and shows, this season contains an amazing story and an unique ending with an unforgettable season finale.<br>(The game does &quot;not&quot; contain jumpscares.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is almost done and coming in the next few months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to add this game to your wishlist and follow it on social media!</p>",
